# What the sdist carries beyond the package itself.
#
# Setuptools' default template picks up `tests/test*.py` and nothing else under
# `tests/`, which leaves out `tests/shapes.py` -- the meshes every test module
# but `test_quadrics.py` imports by name. An sdist whose suite cannot be
# collected is one a distribution packager cannot check before shipping it, so
# the suite, its configuration and the documentation it cites all ship.
recursive-include tests *.py
include tox.ini
recursive-include docs *.md
